{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And all, I will cut off</b> —— 为复数形式，如同论巴勒时的<b>and he fought</b>（与以色列争战）。又如<b>give might</b>（将能力归给）以罗欣。" "<b>The horns of the righteous shall be lifted up</b>（义人的角必被高举）—— 与<b>I will cut off</b>（我必剪除）相反。"], :book "psalms", :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :zh-Hans, :chapter 75, :timestamp "2026-07-28T01:10:44.581195052Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}